# Build System

## Prerequisites (Windows)
This project must be built inside WSL (Ubuntu). The VS Code tasks are already configured to use WSL automatically. If running commands manually, open a WSL terminal first.

## Common Make Targets
| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `make` | Build the ROM (`pokeemerald.gba`) |
| `make check` | Build and run the test suite via mGBA |
| `make debug` | Build with `-Og -g` for debugger use |
| `make compare` | Build and compare against original ROM checksum |
| `make clean` | Remove all build artifacts |

## Build Flags (override on command line)
| Flag | Default | Effect |
|------|---------|--------|
| `TEST=1` | 0 | Enables test runner build |
| `DEBUG=1` | 0 | Enables debug symbols and `-Og` |
| `ANALYZE=1` | 0 | Enables `-fanalyzer` for deep UB analysis |

Example: `make DEBUG=1`

## Toolchain
- Compiler: `arm-none-eabi-gcc` (DevkitARM or system install inside WSL)
- Assembler: `arm-none-eabi-as`
- Flags: `-mthumb -mthumb-interwork -std=gnu17 -O2 -march=armv4t -mtune=arm7tdmi`

## Build Output
- ROM: `pokeemerald.gba`
- Objects: `build/modern/` (normal), `build/modern-test/` (tests), `build/modern-debug/` (debug)

## Rebuilding Tools
If custom tools in `tools/` need recompiling (e.g. after a pull): `bash build_tools.sh`
